          "docs": "The API endpoint provides the functionality to seamlessly generate a PDF document template by utilizing the provided HTML content while incorporating pre-defined fields.<br><b>Related Guides</b><br><a href=\"https://www.docuseal.com/guides/create-pdf-document-fillable-form-with-html-api\" class=\"link\">Create PDF document fillable form with HTML</a>"
