          "docs": "The API endpoint provides the functionality to create a fillable document template for a PDF file. Use <code>{{Field Name;role=Signer1;type=date}}</code> text tags to define fillable fields in the document. See <a href=\"https://www.docuseal.com/examples/fieldtags.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link font-bold\">https://www.docuseal.com/examples/fieldtags.pdf</a> for more text tag formats. Or specify the exact pixel coordinates of the document fields using `fields` param.<br><b>Related Guides</b><br><"
